{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132350","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013235001:0":{"text":"아쉽게도 한 번밖에 못 봬서 서운하네요! 아주 재미있으신 분 같았는데 말이죠.","source_cn":"可惜只见了一面，好遗憾！看起来是位很有趣的半神大人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB306C01497E6E03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013235002:0":{"text":"반신 샤키탈리스의 실력은 절대 단순히 “재미”에 국한되어 있지 않아요...","source_cn":"半神萨基塔里斯的实力，可绝不仅是“有趣”而已……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B55D975ADA5ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013235003:0":{"text":"신마 대전에서 샤키탈리스는 듀라의 택함을 받고 반신으로 승격되어 악마와 맞서 싸우는 데에만 평생을 바쳤어요.","source_cn":"在神魔大战中，萨基塔里斯被艾雅选中，升格为半神，致力于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C784EBA0E82B7E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013235004:0":{"text":"그러니까 샤키탈리스님은 우리로서는 실력을 가늠할 수조차 없는 강자라는 뜻입니다!","source_cn":"所以说，萨基塔里斯大人是深不可测的强者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBC43152B8B62B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013235005:0":{"text":"신마 대전이라고요? 제가 역사는 잘 몰라서... 아주 오래전에 있었던 일 아닌가요?","source_cn":"神魔大战？我历史可能不太好……那不是很久之前的事情吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF0DEA7B8FA343C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013235006:0":{"text":"맞아요. 아주 오래전의 일이죠...","source_cn":"没错。很久之前了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0787480AF511EFEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}